{% comment %}Shibra Technical Services - Dubai construction and maintenance homepage{% endcomment %}
<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="container hero-content">
    <div class="eyebrow">Construction, Fit-Out &amp; Maintenance · Dubai, UAE</div>
    <h1>Building with Care.<br>Finishing with <span style="color:var(--gold)">Precision.</span></h1>
    <p>Dependable construction and technical services for residential and commercial properties across Dubai. From structural work to interior finishing, we help bring every project together.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="btn" href="#services">EXPLORE OUR SERVICES</a>
      <a class="btn-outline" href="#contact">REQUEST A QUOTE</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-note">INTERIOR FIT-OUT · FORMWORK · MASONRY · PAINTING · MAINTENANCE</div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="trust-strip">
  <div class="container trust-inner">
    <span>Quality Workmanship</span>
    <span>Professional Service</span>
    <span>Residential &amp; Commercial</span>
    <span>Dubai, UAE</span>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section services" id="services">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="section-kicker">What We Do</div>
      <h2>Construction &amp; Maintenance Services</h2>
      <p>From the building structure to the final finish, Shibra Technical Services provides practical solutions for a wide range of construction and property requirements.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service-grid">
      <article class="service-card"><span class="service-no">01 / INTERIORS</span><h3>Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out</h3><p>Interior improvement and fit-out solutions designed to make residential and commercial spaces functional, comfortable and refined.</p></article>
      <article class="service-card"><span class="service-no">02 / FINISHING</span><h3>Painting Works</h3><p>Interior and exterior painting, including careful surface preparation and neat finishing for walls and ceilings.</p></article>
      <article class="service-card"><span class="service-no">03 / STRUCTURAL</span><h3>Formwork &amp; Shuttering</h3><p>Formwork and shuttering support for concrete construction, with attention to measurements, alignment and site requirements.</p></article>
      <article class="service-card"><span class="service-no">04 / BLOCK WORK</span><h3>Block Work</h3><p>Block laying and wall construction for partitions and building projects, completed with care and accuracy.</p></article>
      <article class="service-card"><span class="service-no">05 / MASONRY</span><h3>Masonry Works</h3><p>General masonry services for building, repair and property improvement requirements in residential and commercial spaces.</p></article>
      <article class="service-card"><span class="service-no">06 / PLASTER</span><h3>Plaster Works</h3><p>Wall and ceiling plastering and surface preparation to create smooth, even finishes ready for decoration.</p></article>
      <article class="service-card"><span class="service-no">07 / PROPERTY CARE</span><h3>Building Maintenance</h3><p>General building maintenance and repair support to help keep properties safe, functional and presentable.</p></article>
      <article class="service-card"><span class="service-no">08 / CONSTRUCTION</span><h3>General Construction</h3><p>Construction assistance and coordinated site works for a variety of residential and commercial project needs.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="container about-grid">
    <div class="about-image" role="img" aria-label="Modern building and construction work">
      <div class="image-label"><strong>One Team</strong>For Construction &amp; Property Care</div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <div class="section-kicker">About Shibra</div>
      <h2>Practical Solutions. Professional Results.</h2>
      <p>Shibra Technical Services supports property owners, businesses and contractors with construction, interior finishing and building maintenance services in Dubai, United Arab Emirates.</p>
      <p>We focus on understanding each project’s requirements, communicating clearly and carrying out work with attention to quality and detail.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Construction and finishing services under one roof</li>
        <li>Clear communication from enquiry to completion</li>
        <li>Careful workmanship and attention to detail</li>
        <li>Support for residential and commercial properties</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn" href="#contact">TALK TO OUR TEAM</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section why">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="section-kicker">Why Choose Shibra</div>
      <h2>Good work starts with the right team.</h2>
      <p>We aim to make your construction or maintenance project straightforward, from the first conversation to the finishing details.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="why-grid">
      <div class="why-item"><b>Quality Focus</b><p>Careful attention to workmanship, materials and the details that matter.</p></div>
      <div class="why-item"><b>Clear Communication</b><p>Practical updates and straightforward coordination throughout the job.</p></div>
      <div class="why-item"><b>Multiple Services</b><p>Construction, masonry, plastering, painting and interior fit-out support.</p></div>
      <div class="why-item"><b>Dubai Based</b><p>Services for residential and commercial property requirements in Dubai.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="projects">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="section-kicker">Project Gallery</div>
      <h2>Work that shapes better spaces.</h2>
      <p>Explore the types of work our services cover. These are illustrative stock photographs; replace them with Shibra’s actual project photos before publishing the website as a company portfolio.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="projects-grid">
      <article class="project"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687939-ce8a6c25118c?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1000&amp;q=85" alt="Contemporary interior design and fit-out" loading="lazy"><div class="project-caption"><small>INTERIOR FIT-OUT</small><h3>Interior Spaces</h3></div></article>
      <article class="project"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504307651254-35680f356dfd?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=900&amp;q=85" alt="Construction work at a building site" loading="lazy"><div class="project-caption"><small>CONSTRUCTION</small><h3>On-Site Works</h3></div></article>
      <article class="project"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1484154218962-a197022b5858?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=900&amp;q=85" alt="Finished residential interior" loading="lazy"><div class="project-caption"><small>FINISHING</small><h3>Quality Finishes</h3></div></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="container cta-inner">
    <div><h2>Have a project in mind?</h2><p>Speak with our team about your construction or maintenance requirements.</p></div>
    <a class="btn btn-dark" href="#contact">REQUEST A QUOTE ↗</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section contact" id="contact">
  <div class="container contact-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="section-kicker">Contact Our Team</div>
      <h2>Let’s discuss your project.</h2>
      <p>Send us your details and a short description of the work you need. Our team can follow up to discuss the next steps.</p>
      <div class="contact-details">
        <div class="contact-detail"><b>Location</b><span>Dubai, United Arab Emirates</span></div>
        <div class="contact-detail"><b>Services</b><span>Construction · Interior Fit-Out · Building Maintenance</span></div>
        <div class="contact-detail"><b>Phone &amp; Email</b><span>Please add the company’s verified phone number and email address.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-form">
      {% form 'contact' %}
        {% if form.posted_successfully? %}<p role="status">Thank you. Your enquiry has been sent successfully.</p>{% endif %}
        {{ form.errors | default_errors }}
        <div class="form-row">
          <div class="field"><label for="ContactName">Your Name</label><input id="ContactName" type="text" name="contact[name]" autocomplete="name" required></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="ContactEmail">Email Address</label><input id="ContactEmail" type="email" name="contact[email]" autocomplete="email" required></div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-row">
          <div class="field"><label for="ContactPhone">Phone Number</label><input id="ContactPhone" type="tel" name="contact[phone]" autocomplete="tel"></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="ContactService">Service Required</label><select id="ContactService" name="contact[Service]"><option>Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out</option><option>Painting Works</option><option>Formwork &amp; Shuttering</option><option>Block Work</option><option>Masonry Works</option><option>Plaster Works</option><option>Building Maintenance</option><option>General Construction</option><option>Other</option></select></div>
        </div>
        <div class="field"><label for="ContactMessage">Project Details</label><textarea id="ContactMessage" name="contact[body]" placeholder="Tell us about your project and the work required..." required></textarea></div>
        <button class="btn" type="submit">SEND ENQUIRY</button>
      {% endform %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

